From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rezoss <rezoss79@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 19 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Force Now Brief non-empty fallback

On dm3q the S26U SmartSuggestions ranker can resolve the current time to
EarlyAfternoon with no morning/evening context, leaving AiSuggestionBriefType as
NONE. The document builder still creates useful calendar/weather/news
candidates, but RuleBaseRankingFilter removes all of them because the brief
type is NONE.

Keep Samsung's explicit morning/evening checks intact and only fall back to
MORNING when neither check matches, so Now Brief has a displayable brief type
instead of writing app_widget_brief_type=3 and pushing empty RemoteViews.

---
diff --git a/smali_classes14/com/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/feature/aisuggestion/core/ranker/AiSuggestionRanker.smali b/smali_classes14/com/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/feature/aisuggestion/core/ranker/AiSuggestionRanker.smali
--- a/smali_classes14/com/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/feature/aisuggestion/core/ranker/AiSuggestionRanker.smali
+++ b/smali_classes14/com/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/feature/aisuggestion/core/ranker/AiSuggestionRanker.smali
@@ -5870,6 +5870,8 @@
     goto :goto_0
 
     :cond_1
+    sget-object v2, Lcom/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/feature/aisuggestion/documentrepository/domain/entity/AiSuggestionBriefType;->MORNING:Lcom/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/feature/aisuggestion/documentrepository/domain/entity/AiSuggestionBriefType;
+
     invoke-virtual {p0}, Lcom/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/feature/aisuggestion/core/ranker/AiSuggestionRanker;->clearBeforeSleepPreference()V
 
     :goto_0
